   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/rajeevrajan2_ai-agenticai-physicalai-activity-7520663720121847808-huqO",
   "text": "\u2728It was electric at the CASPA - Chinese American Semiconductor Professional Assoc. 2026 event!  Highlights included:\n\n\ud83d\udd37 CASPA at 35: Celebrated CASPA\u2019s 35th anniversary at the Santa Clara Convention Center, featuring its largest-ever global gathering of semiconductor CEOs.\n\ud83d\udd37 Next-decade focus: Under \u201cSilicon, Systems, and Intelligence: Designing the Next Decade,\u201d the agenda centered on the economics, power architectures, and scalability of AI infrastructure.\n\ud83d\udd37 Executive lineup: The dinner banquet featured an amazing on-stage fireside chat with Intel\u2019s Lip-Bu Tan and CASPA President Jimmy Cheng, plus insights from 35+ leaders across the industry, including SiMa.ai d-Matrix Cerebras Normal Com",
