  "7520640834547920897": {
   "created": 1793060501,
   "author": "JP Chen",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jpcal6ix_private-capital-frenzy-etched-three-years-activity-7520640834547920897-rs7C",
   "text": "PRIVATE CAPITAL FRENZY | Etched\n\nThree years ago, VCs were turning down Gavin Uberti. Today, at 24, he's CEO of an AI chip startup whose valuation doubled from $10.3B at Series C to $21B within two months. Investors are now reportedly offering $40B\u2013$50B valuations for its next private financing.\n\nHere's how a company few investors wanted became one everyone wants access to.\n\nGavin met Chris Zhu in a Harvard math class. Robert W. was his roommate. The three dropped out to challenge Nvidia with specialized AI inference chips.\n\nIn 2023, they spent 100 hours preparing a 30-page technical memo: AI inference would become a massive market requiring specialized hardware.\n\nMajor VCs passed. Etched ha",
