   "added": 1793081770
  },
  "7520650973430591488": {
   "created": 1793062919,
   "author": "Saasverse",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/saasverse-global_aichips-semiconductors-artificialintelligence-activity-7520650973430591488-lTfj",
   "text": "\u26a1 AI Chips \u2014 Valuation by Saasverse\nThe race to build the post-NVIDIA silicon stack now has a price list.\nOur landscape maps the 10 most valuable private AI chip companies. Three signals stand out:\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Consolidation has already redrawn this map once. NVIDIA's ~$20B licensing deal for Groq's LPU technology, Marvell Technology's acquisition of Celestial AI, and Cerebras' IPO at a ~$95B market cap have all landed within the past year. Several names on this list will not stay private for long. \ud83e\udd1d\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 The top of the chart is still talk. Etched leads at $40B+ \u2014 an in-talks figure, nearly double its $21B last priced round. No other name on the list is close. \ud83d\udcc8\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 It is not a US-only race. South Kor",
   "disc_score": 1,
