  "7520638000423206912": {
   "created": 1793059825,
   "author": "Bo Li",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/boli99_etched-fireside-chat-hardware-software-codesign-activity-7520638000423206912-Vq08",
   "text": "Fireside chat with Etched, please RSVP if you're interested! \n\n\"Etched just launched this summer. We've built and shipped our first rack after a successful A0 tapeout, $1B+ in customer contracts, and a $21B Series C. Learn more about what hardware-software codesign looks like at gigawatt scale. We'll have pizza & merch!\" \n\nhttps://luma.com/64389ifr",
