  "7520736150089695233": {
   "created": 1793083226,
   "author": "Chih-Kuan Ho",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/chihkuan-ho_caspa-semiconductors-siliconvalley-activity-7520736150089695233-_sDC",
   "text": "What an incredible experience volunteering at the CASPA 35th Annual Conference and CEO Summit last weekend! \ud83d\ude80\n\nHelping coordinate an event of this magnitude\u2014bringing close to 2,000 attendees and some of the brightest minds in the semiconductor industry to the Santa Clara Convention Center\u2014was truly inspiring. For this milestone event, I had the privilege of taking on two distinct and rewarding roles: serving as the Auditorium Lighting Control Operator and the Chief Editor of the Yearbook.\n\nA major highlight of the conference was the CEO Summit, where more than 35 Silicon Valley executives gathered to discuss the next wave of silicon capital, AI infrastructure, and the evolving economics of o",
