  "7520763577394221056": {
   "created": 1793089765,
   "author": "Rene van Pelt",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/rene-van-pelt_ai-artificialintelligence-ainews-activity-7520763577394221056-cP8A",
   "text": "Etched leads AI Brief's list of 10 private AI chip companies at a $21B valuation from August 2026, ahead of SambaNova at $11B. \n\nCerebras is not on it, because it has been public on Nasdaq since May 2026.\n\nThe list is ordered by latest reported valuation and ends with FuriosaAI at about $720M. The figures use different dates and bases, so they are a snapshot.\n\nOn the list: Etched, SambaNova, Tenstorrent, Positron AI, Unconventional AI, Groq, Rebellions, d-Matrix, Tensordyne and FuriosaAI.\n\nRead more here: https://lnkd.in/eWYkMSSG\n\nSubscribe to one of our AI Newsletters: https://lnkd.in/eu2DYMuX\n\n|#ai #artificialintelligence #ainews",
   "disc_score": 1,
