  "7520869770536218625": {
   "created": 1793115084,
   "author": "\u2728Madhavi Rajan",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/madhavi-rajan_caspa-semiconductors-aihardware-activity-7520869770536218625-yGeo",
   "text": "Spent the weekend at the CASPA Annual Conference and CEO Summit engaging with the leaders charting the next phase of semiconductor innovation.\n\nThe hardware landscape is diversifying rapidly. Watching Gavin Uberti (CEO of Etched) and fellow panelists contrast emerging architectures underscored a clear market reality. The future of AI scaling belongs to domain specific, hyper efficient hardware options rather than general purpose compute alone.\n\nFor leadership, the fireside chat with Lip-Bu Tan on the Intel turnaround offered valuable insights into execution. His grounded approach to corporate governance was striking, specifically his philosophy on velocity over perfection. Aiming for 70% dec",
   "disc_score": 17,
