   "text": "Hi all! My team at Etched is growing, and we\u2019re hiring a General Ledger, Close role to join our world-class finance team.\nWe\u2019ve shipped our first production racks to Jane Street, and customer demand has been sky-high.\n\nApply here: https://lnkd.in/g7kgjwFV\n\nTo learn more, reach out to Jake on my team at jake@etched.com",
