   "author": "CASPA Office",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/caspa-office-595263a_caspa-caspa35-ceosummit-activity-7521082092634677248-Bf9J",
   "text": "CASPA 35th Annual Conference | The CEO Summit -  Day 2 Recap\n\nOn Saturday, October 24, Day 2 of the CASPA 35th Annual Conference: The CEO Summit brought together leaders from across the semiconductor and AI ecosystem for a full day of keynotes, panels, and executive conversations at the Santa Clara Convention Center.\n\nFrom chip design and advanced manufacturing to AI compute, data storage, optical interconnects, and cybersecurity, the discussions showed how interconnected the ecosystem has become.\n\n\u25b8 Morning Keynotes\nAjit Manocha, CEO of SEMI: \u201cTransforming Industry Collaboration: Navigating AI Era Inflections\u201d\nMary Ellen Randall, President & CEO of IEEE: \u201cAdvancing Humanity through Responsi",
   "disc_score": 14,
